  "notes": [
    "The third argument of vs.SetDashStyleN counts the dash and gap values, so 4 gives two pairs. vs.Name2Index returns the index of Rosetta-Dash, and a negative index names a line type.",
    "Rosetta-Red is red with line weight 50 mils and line style 2, a solid line. A class made after vs.SetDashStyleN takes Rosetta-Dash, so the script sets line style 2. Rosetta-Blue is blue with line weight 10 mils and the Rosetta-Dash line type. None is the active class at the end."
  ]
